Subject: [PATCH 2/2] A recorder for the classroom demo: an MP4 with Aria's
 voice, to share

Chrome's screencast on the GPU for the frames; each narration clip captured as its blob becomes a
URL (the player frees the URL right after use) and placed by ffmpeg where it started playing.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
